The historical course sample binaries/test clients were not supplied.
No signed ethics document has been created or represented as the author's.

mydc.s is handwritten IA-32 assembly. On Apple Silicon the run script uses
Clang's i386 ELF assembler and Unicorn with a limited libc bridge.
It is not a replacement C implementation or a complete Linux runtime.
